<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Dowe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Paulo kwa Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Walu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Walumi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ino ya mtumigwa Paulo kwa Walumi ikudahikana iyandikigwa hagati ya mwaka hamsini na nne na mwaka hamsini na nane tangu aelekigwe Yesu Kilisito. Chipindi icho Paulo kakala hanafika Lumi ivo katuma baluwa ino kwa kulonda kuwalongela want'hu wamtogole Kilisito wakalile wakukala mdibululu da Lumi, Wayahudi na want'hu sio Wayahudi. Paulo kaiyandika baluwa ino akawa kuna dibululu da kolinto hant'hu aho nio akalile akukala chipindi icho. Kaiandika baluwa kwa kulonda want'hu wa isi zose wamtogole na kumtegeleza Yesu Kilisito sula ya 16:26.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ino ikufaya nk'hani kwa want'hu wamtogole Kilisito wa kila hant'hu na wavipindi vose, gesa Paulo ivo akusimulila goya mbuli ya uhonyi ula chikuupata kufosela Yesu Kilisito. Vilavila Paulo kaunga Mbuli Idamane ya Yesu Kilisito na Lagano da umwaka. Wasomile wengi wakutogola kuwa aya ikutimalala gesa tegemezi kulu na ula ukutoza nt'hume ngima ya baluwa ino ni ula ukupatikana sula ya 1:16 ukulonga, “Sikuiionela chinyala Mbuli Idamane, kwavila ni udahi wa Mulungu ukugala uhonyi, kwa chila mnt'hu akutogola kwandusila kwa Myahudi na want'hu sio Wayahudi.” Hant'hu hamwanduso wa baluwa ino ya Walumi kwandusila sula ya 1-12 ikusimulila mbuli nk'hulu na muhimu nkhani ya umanyi wa Mulungu. Na hant'hu hakaidi ha baluwa ino kwandusila sula ya 13-15 ikusimulila malagilizo ya vila wanthu wamtogole Kilisito ivo wakulondigwa wakale.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeli umo</para>
  <para style="io">Mtumigwa Paulo akwandusa baluwa yake kwa kuisimulila yeye mwenyewe na kulonga akuwaandikila achina niani muna i sula 1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Na akuandika vilaeli mnt'hu eli na zambi na vila akudaha kuhonyigwa kufosela Yesu Kilisito muna i sula ya 1:16-11:36</para>
  <para style="io">Kamala Paulo akusimulila vila want'hu wamtogole Kilisito ivowakulondigwa kutenda na kukala muna i sula ya 12:1-15:13</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akukomeza kuandika baluwa kwa kuwalamsa want'hu wose wamtogole Kilisito wa uko kudibululu da Lumi muna i Sula ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nie Paulo, mtwana wa Kilisito Yesu na mtumigwa nisaguligwe na kutangigwa na Mulungu kwaajili ya kulonga Mbuli yake Idamane. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Aho umwaka, Mulungu kawalongela want'hu kufosela walotezi wake muna Maandiko Yake kuwa naawagalile Mbuli Idamane. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Mbuli ino Idamane ikulonga mbuli za Mwana wa Mulungu, Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, iyo kwa unt'hu wake, kaelekigwa mulukolo lwa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />kwa mbuli ya unank'hani wake wa Chimulungu, kalagiswa kwa udahi mkulu kuwa ni Mwana wa Mulungu kwa kubwelezigwa muugima. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kwa kufosela Yesu Kilisito, nihokela wende wa kuwa mtumigwa wa kuwalongoza want'hu wa isi zose wadahe kutogola na kutegeleza. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ivoelo namweye namwe msaguligwa muwe want'hu wa Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Elo, huwaandikila mweye mose mkukala Loma wala mkubwedigwa na Mulungu na akawasagula muwe want'hu wake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Humulomba Mulungu Tati yetu na Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, awenk'he mweye wende na nt'hindiwalo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumulomba Mulungu na kumwink'ha hewala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Tenk'hu humwink'ha hewala Mulungu wangu kufosela Yesu Kilisito kwaajili ya mweye mose, kwa vila utogozi wenu ukulongigwa mui isi yose. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mulungu iyo humsank'hanila kwa moyo wangu wose muna kuilonga Mbuli Idamane ya Mwanake, yeye nio akuona na akumanya ivo huwakumbukeni siku zose muna ukolomba kwangu. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Humulomba Mulungu akabweda nipate nyafasi ya kwiza kumwenu vino haluse. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Hulonda nk'hani niwaone ili niwataze mudahe kuhokela vitumetume va kimuhe ili kuwatenda mtoge muutogozi wenu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Icho hulonga ni chino, nie naniwagele moyo kwa utogozi wangu kwa Kilisito na utogozi wenu unigele moyo nie. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ndugu zangu, hulonda mmanye kuwa chila mala nilonda kwiza kumwenu, mbali hadi haluse kuna vint'hu vikunitenda nisekwiza. Nilonda nize kuilonga kumwenu Mbuli iyo idamane ili niwatende want'hu wamtogole Yesu Kilisito, gesa ivonitendile kwa want'hu isi zimwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nie hulondigwa kuwalongela Mbuli Idamane want'hu wose, Wagiliki na wala sio Wagiliki, na kuwalongela wala weli na umanyi na wala wabule umanyi. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ivoelo, hulonda nk'hani kulonga Mbuli Idamane kumwenu mweye mkukala mdibululu da Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguvu ya Mbuli Idamane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nie sikuona chinyala kulonga Mbuli Idamane, kwavila Mbuli Idamane ni nguvu ya Mulungu ya kumuhonya chila mnt'hu ila akumtogola Kilisito, kuandusila kwa Wayahudi vilavila na wala sio Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwavila Mbuli Idamane ikulagisa Mulungu ivoakulonda chiwe ili chitogoligwe halongozi hake, mbuli ino ikutendeka kwa utogofu, kulawa mwanduso hadi nk'homelezo muutogozi wako, gesa ivoiyandikigwe, “Mnt'hu adamane kwa Mulungu naakale kwa kulongozwa na utogozi.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maya ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Maya ya Mulungu yalagiswa kulawa kuulanga kwa mbuli zose zihile na ubananzi wa want'hu wala kwa nzila zao zihile wakuilema kweli isekumanyika. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kwavila Mbuli zose za Mulungu zikudaha kumanyika mmwawe bila kufisa, kwa vila Mulungu mwenyewekawalagisa. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kwandusila kuumbwa kwa isi, udahi wa Mulungu wa siku zose bila uhelelo na Ulungu wake, hata ikawa haukuoneka kwa meso, mbali ukumanyika bila ya kufisa. Want'hu wakudaha kuzimanya mbuli izo kulawana na vint'hu aviumbile Mulungu. Ivoelo wabule nzila yoyote ya kuibengela. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Want'hu ao ingawa wakumanya kuna Mulungu mbali hawamtunyile gesa Mulungu wala kumwink'ha hewala, mbali waga mzimbuli zawe zihile, na myoyo yawe ili na uhenye haiimanyile nt'hume ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Wakuiyona wana umanyi mbali ni wahenye. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Wakuleka kumfugamalila Mulungu ila hakudanganika na wakufugamalila nyank'hiti zilingile mnt'hu akudanganika, walingane na wanyama, ndege, egu wanyama wakutambala. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ivoelo, Mulungu akawaleka wagendelele kumelela mate mbuli zawe zihile na kutendelana mbuli za chinyala ao kwa ao. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Kwavila wakuibidula kweli ya Mulungu kuwa uhuni, na wakufugamalila na kusank'hanila vint'hu vilumbigwe na Mulungu, mbali hakumfugamalila Mulungu aviumbile vint'hu ivo, ila akulondigwa kutunyigwa siku zose. Tawile! <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwa kutenda ayo, Mulungu kawaleka wagelane chinyala kwa kukola mbuli zawe za chinyala, hata wanake waleka kutenda mbuli wakulondigwa kutenda na walume zao na wakatendelana ao kwa ao. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Vilavila na wanaalume wakaleka kutenda mbuli wakulondigwa kutenda na wake zao na wakutendelana ao kwa ao, na kwa kutenda ivo wakuitendela ulamuzi wawe wenyewe kwa mbuli zawe zihile. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwavila want'hu walema kummanya Mulungu, Mulungu kawaleka wagendelele kukola magesa yawe hayakufaya, na wakatenda mbuli walemesigwe kutenda. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Want'hu wano wamemwa na mbuli zose zihile, uhankhu, miongo, kukoma, ndwagi, uhuni na makambilo yehile na wanthu ao vilavila kuteta wayawe, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na kuzigana, na want'hu wakutenda mbuli za kumwihiza Mulungu, wakuiduvya, magodelo, magalu nk'hani wa kutenda mbuli zihile na hawakuwategeleza welesi wawe, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />ni wahenye na hawakutenda yala walongile nawatende, wabule ubwedo wala ubazi kwa wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Want'hu ao wakumanya goya kuwa mnt'hu akatenda mbuli zihile gesa zino akulondeka akomigwe. Hata ivo hawakukola ndagilizi ya Mulungu ivo ikulonga mbali wakuwadenk'helela want'hu wakutenda mbuli gesa izo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulamuzi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ivo mbuyangu, ikawa ukuwalamula wamwenga, hukudaha mbwi kuigombela hata ikawa weye ni niani. Kwa vila kwa kuwalamula wamwenga, ukuilondela mbuli zihile weye mwenyewe kwa vila naweye ukutenda mbuli zilazila ukuwalamulila wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Chikumanya kuwa ulamuzi wa Mulungu kwa wala wakutenda mbuli gesa izo ni ulamuzi wa kweli. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Na weye ndugu yangu, ukuwalamula wala wakutenda mbuli izo kuno na weye ukuzitenda mbuli izoizo, vino, ukumanya ukudaha kuubenga ulamuzi wa Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Egu, ukuuzela wingi wa ujomwa wake na kufinyiliza kwake na kugozela kwake, bila kumanya kuwa uo ujomwa wake ukukulongoza ili uleke zambi na kumbidukila Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Mbali weye hukuhulika na haukulonda kuleka kutenda zambi, ivo ukuimemezela maya muna isiku ila ya lamulo dya Mulungu dikulonda kugubulwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Siku iyo Mulungu naamulihe kila mnt'hu kwa chila atendile. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Want'hu wala wakugendelela kutenda yajomwane na wakulonda kutunyigwa na kutogoligwa na kukala bila kudanganika, ao Mulungu naawenk'he ugima wa siku zose bila uhelelo. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Mbali kwa wala want'hu wakutenda mbuli zawe wenyewe na wala wakuilema kweli ya Mulungu na kukola mbuli zihile, wakumgela maya Mulungu, na Mulungu naawalamule. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ivo, nakuwe na mahenyeko na magayo kwa want'hu wose wakutenda mbuli zihile, kwandusila kwa Wayahudi na kwa want'hu sio Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Mbali Mulungu naawatende wahongezigwe na kutogoligwa, nakuwe na nt'hindiwalo kwa want'hu wose wakutenda mbuli zidamane, kwandusila kwa Wayahudi na want'hu sio Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kwavila, Mulungu akuwalamula want'hu gesa vila ikulondigwa bila kulola yeye niani. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Want'hu wose sio Wayahudi wala wakutenda zambi bila kuyamanya Malagilzo ya Mulungu amwink'hile Musa nawaangamile bila Malagilizo. Na wala Wayahudi wakutenda zambi kuno wakuyamanya Malagilizo ya Mulungu amwink'hile Musa nawalamuligwe na Malagilizo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwavila sio wala wakuyahulika Malagilizo ndo nawatogoligwe halongozi ha Mulungu. Mbali wala wakuyahulika na kuyatenda Malagilizo ao ndo wakulonda kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Kwavila want'hu sio Wayahudi, wala wabule Malagilizo ya Musa, mbali wakatenda kulawa muna miyoyo yawe yala yakulondigwa na Malagilizo, ao wenyewe wakuwa na Malagilizo mgati mmwao, hamwenga na kuwa wabule Malagilizo ya Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Want'hu ao ivowakukala wakulagisa kuwa wakumanya yala akuyalonda Mulungu gesa vila Mulungu kayaandika Malagilizo yake mgati mmwawe na magesa yawe yana udahi ya kulamula yadamane na yehile. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Kwa Mbuli Idamane ino huilonga, nivo ikulonda kuwa siku ya Mulungu akalonda kuzilamula mbuli zose zifisike za want'hu kufosela Yesu kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na Malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Mbali weye ukuitanga Muyahudi, na kuyasigamila Malagilizo na ukuigoda kuwa ni mnt'hu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Ukuyamanya yala akuyalonda Mulungu na ukudaha kusagula mbuli ukulondigwa kuzitenda, kwa vila kuifunza Malagilizo. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Weye ukuiona kuwa chilongozi wa want'hu hawakuona na ulumuli kwa wala want'hu wamdiziza, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ukuiona mfunza wa wahenye na mfunza wa want'hu hawanaumanya ukweli wa utogozi, kwavila ukulonga una umanyi wa kweli muna ayo Malagilizo. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Weye ukuwafunza wamwenga, hangi hukuifunza weye mwenyewe? Ukuwalongela wamwenga msekubawa mbali weye mwenyewe ukubawa. <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ukuwalongela wamwenga msekutenda uhank'hu, mbali weye mwenyewe ukutenda uhank'hu, ukwihizwa na nyank'hinti za milungu, mbali weye mwenyewe ukubawa vint'hu kulawa muzinyumba za kuwafugamalila milungu iyo. <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Weye ukuigoda kuwa ukuyamanya Malagilizo, mbali ukumzela Mulungu kwa kuleka Malagilizo yake. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Gesa Maandiko ivoyalongile, “Want'hu wa isi zimwenga nawamdukane Mulungu kwaajili yenu mweye Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kwavila ulungwana ukufaya nk'hani ukawa ukuyatoza Malagilizo, mbali ukawa kuyaleka ukuwa gesa mnt'hu hanaupata ulungwana. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ivila, ikawa mnt'hu wa isi zimwenga hanapata ulungwana mbali akuyatenda yala yalagizwe muna Malagilizo Mulungu akumtogola mnt'hu iyo na akuwa gesa mnt'hu apatile ulungwana. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ivo, want'hu wa isi zimwenga nawawawalamule mweye Wayahudi, ikawa muleka kuyatoza Malagilizo, na muna Malagilizo na ulungwana. Na kuno ao wayatoza Malagilizo na wanaulungwana. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ino ni kulonga kuwa, sio chila mnt'hu akwelekigwa na Muyahuydi naawe ni muyahudi wa kweli, wala mnt'hu hakuwa mnt'hu wa Mulungu kwavila kenk'higwa ulungwana. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Mbali Muyahudi wa kweli ni ila eli Muyahudi kwa mgati, mbali ni ila apatile ulungwana muna umoyo wake. Mbuli ino ikutendwa na Muhe, na sio mbuli ya maandiko ya Malagilizo. Na mnt'hu eli vino nahokele utunyo kulawa kwa Mulungu na sikulawa kwa want'hu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ivo, Muyahudi ana chibwani chikulu cha kuwahuma want'hu sio Wayahudi? Egu ulungwana ukufaya mbwani? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ena, kuwa Muyahudi kukufaya nk'hani, kwavila Mulungu kaandusa kuwenk'ha ao Wayahudi Malagilizo yake. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Mbali naiweze ikawa wamwenga mgati yao wakawa sio watogofu wa Mulungu? Vino, ao Wayahudi kutokumtogola kwao na kumtende Mulungu asekuwa mtogofu? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Hata! Seke iwe ivo mbwi. Mulungu naasigale kuwa mtogofu siku zose, ingawa kila mnt'hu muhuni. Gesavila Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kila ukalonga, mbuli yako ikuwa kweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">Na kila ukalamula, ulamuzi wako ukuhuma.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Mbali, ikawa ubananzi wetu ukulagisa Mulungu akutenda vila ikulondigwa, vino chikudaha kulonga, Mulungu akutenda vihile akachilamula? Hano hulonga nie nikawa gesa mnt'hu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Hata! Ingi iwile Mulungu sio mkweli kalonda kudahaze kuwalamula want'hu wa isi? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Want'hu wakudaha kulonga kuwa ikawa kuswela kutogola kwetu kukutenda wamwenga wadahe kuona bila kufisa kuwa Mulungu ni mtogofu, na ao nawaiyohe kumtunya. Elo, hangi chink'hali chikulamulwa kuwa china zambi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Uko ni kulonga kuwa chiwe chikutenda zambi ili mbuli zidamane zilawile. Want'hu wamwenga wakuchiziga kuwa hata cheye chikufunza ivoivo. Na want'hu wakulonga ivo nawalamuligwe kwa ubananzi wawe.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wose watenda zambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Elo chilonge mbwani? Kuwa cheye Wayahudi chikufaya nk'hani kuhuma want'hu sio Wayahudi? Bule! Gesa ivoniwalongele hamwanduso kuwa Wayahudi na want'hu sio Wayahudi wose chikutalamilwa na zambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Habule mnt'hu hata imwe akutenda yala yakumbwedeza Mulungu!<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Habule hata mnt'hu imwe eli na umanyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">wala habule hata mnt'hu imwe akumfugamalila Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Want'hu wose wamuleka Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">watenda mbuli zihile, habule hata mnt'hu imwe akutenda mbuli zikulondigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mamelo yawe yawa gesa kabuli diwazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ndimi zawe ziulonga mbuli za uhuni milomo yawe zikulawa mbuli zina sumu gesa ya zoka<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Kila wakalonga, wakuwalonga vihile wamwenga na mbuli zawe zikuwa za kuwalumiza wamwenga.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Want'hu ao wakutenda hima kwita kuwakoma weyawe,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Hant'hu hohote wakulonda kwita wakubananga vint'hu na wakuwaleka want'hu na usungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ao hawaimanyile nzila ya kukala na want'hu wamwenga kwa nt'hindiwalo.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Want'hu wano hawakulonda kumuogoha Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Elo chikumanya kuwa Malagilizo ya Musa ni ya wala watogole kutalamilwa na Malagilizo ayo, ivo sekewawe na uzigilo wowote, na want'hu wose nawalamulwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ivo habule mnt'hu yoyote naaoneke kadamana halongozi ha Mulungu kwa kutenda vila yakulonda Malagilizo, kwa vila Malagilizo yakuchitenda chizimanye zambi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu akuwatogola want'hu kwa utogozi wawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Mbali elo nzila ya Mulungu ya kuwatenda want'hu watogoligwe halongozi hake imanyika bila kwegamila Malagilizo. Hata Malagilizo ya Musa na ya walotezi yakuchilagisa mbuli ino. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nzila iyo ni utogozi wawe kwa Yesu Kilisito, Mulungu akutenda ivo kwa want'hu wose wamtogolile Kilisito. Kwavila habule cha kuwabagula. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Want'hu wose watenda zambi na waza kutogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Chikutogoligwa na Mulungu bila kulihila kwa wende wake, kwa kufosela Yesu Kilisito ila akuwagombola. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Mulungu kamulava Yesu, ili kwa damu yake awe nzila ya kuwahalavila want'hu zambi zawe kwa kumtogola Yesu. Katenda ivo ili adahe kulagisa kudamana kwake kwa want'hu, kwavila umwaka Mulungu kakala akuzifinyiza zambi wazitendile want'hu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Mulungu katenda mbuli iyo ili kulagisa kuwa yeye kadamana na kawatenda want'hu watogoligwe halongozi hake kwa kumtogola Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ivoelo china chibwani cha kuigodela? Bule! Hangi? Vino, mnt'hu akudaha kuigoda kwavila akutenda vila yakulonda Malagilizo? Bule! Mbali chikuigoda kwavila chikumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Kwavila Mulungu akumtogola mnt'hu kuwa kadamana halongozi hake kwa utogozi wake kwa Yesu, mbali sio kwa kutenda yala yakulondingwa muna Malagilizo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Vino, Mulungu ni Mulungu wa Wayahudi muhala, egu ni Mulungu wa want'hu sio Wayahudi? Hata! Yeye ni Mulungu wa want'hu wose. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Mulungu ni imwe, nae naawatogole kuwa wadamana Wayahudi halongozi hake kwa kutogola kwawe, vilavila naawatogole kuwa wadamana halongozi hake want'hu sio Wayahudi kwa kutogola kwawe. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Vino, chikalonga chikumtogola Yesu, ni kulonga kuwa Malagilizo ya Musa hayakufaya? Hata! Mbali chikamtogola Yesu, ndiho chikutenda yala yakulondigwa na Malagilizo ya Musa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu akumtogola Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Elo chilongeki kwa mbuli ya tati yetu Ibulahimu? Yeye kadahaze kuimanya mbuli ino ya kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ikawa Ibulahimu katogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa yala ayatendile, ana chint'hu cha kuigodela halongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Kwavila Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga, “Ibulahimu kamtogola Mulungu, na Mulungu akamtogola halongozi hake.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mbali mnt'hu akasank'hana maliho yake hayakuwazigwa gesa kitumetume. Ivo akulihwa vila ikulondigwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Kwa mnt'hu hakusegamila nt'hendwa zake mwenyewe, yeye akumtogola Mulungu, ila akuwahalavila wabananzi zambi zawe, Mulungu akuwa kamtogola mnt'hu iyo kuwa kadamana. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Nae Daudi kalonga mbuli ya ubwedo wa mnt'hu ila atogoligwe halongozi ha Mulungu kuwa kadamana bila kulola mbuli zake atendile, Daudi akulonga vino,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Nawabwede wala wasegezelwe zambi zawe, na zambi izo zihalavigwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Naabwede nk'hani mnt'hu ila Mulungu hakuzikumbuka zambi zake.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Vino, ubwedo uno aulongile Daudi ni kwa wala wapatile ulungwana muhala? Egu na kwa wala hawanaupata ulungwana? Ena, na kwa wala hawanaupata ulungwana. Kwavila chilonga kale kuwa, “Ibulahimu katogola, na Mulungu akamtogola kuwa kadamana.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Vino, Ibulahimu katogoligwa na Mulungu ivoakalile hanaupata ulungwana egu ivo aupatile ulungwana? Katogoligwa na Mulungu ank'hali hanaupata ulungwana na sio ivoapatile ulungwana. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ibulahimu kaupata ulungwana ivochifosile chipindi icho, na ulungwana uo ukala ulagiso wa kuwa Mulungu kamtogola kuwa kadamana halongozi hake kwa ula utogozi wake akalile nao ivo akalile hanaingila ulungwana. Ivo elo, Ibulahimu kawa tata wa want'hu wose wakumtogola Mulungu hata ikawa hanaingila ulungwana, kwavila wamtogola Mulungu wakatendigwa wadamana. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Vilavila, Ibulahimu ni tata wa wala waingilile ulungwana, mbali si kwavila waingila ulungwana bali kwavila wakukola nzila ilaila ya kutogola kwa tati yetu Ibulahimu aikolile chipindi hanaingila ulungwana.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalongigwe na Mulungu yakuhokelwa kwa kutogola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Mulungu kamulongela na Ibulahimu na weleko wake kuwa isi yose naiwe yenu. Kalonga ivo si kwavila Ibulahimu katenda vila yakulonda Malagilizo ya Musa, mbali kwavila katogola na kulagisa kuwa kadamana. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kwavila, ikawa wakulondigwa kuhokela yala alongile Mulungu ni wala wakuyakola Malagilizo muhala, ivo kutogola nakuwe kubule mana yoyote na yala alongile Mulungu ni yauhuni. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Kwavila Malagilizo nio yakutenda maya ya Mulungu ilawile. Mbali hant'hu kukawa kubule Malagilizo nakuwe kubule ubananzi. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwa mbuli ino, yala alongile Mulungu yakulawila kwa nzila ya kutogola, ivo icho akilongile Mulungu chikulawana na ujomwa wake, ili yala ayalongile yawe ya kweli kwa want'hu wose, si kwa wala wakukola Malagilizo Muhala, mbali hamwenga na wala watogole gesa Ibulahimu. Yeye ni tati yetu chose. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Gesavila Maandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga, “Nikuika uwe tata wa want'hu wa isi nyingi.” Mbuli iyo ni kweli halongozi ha Mulungu ila Ibulahimu amtogole, Mulungu ila akuwabweleza want'hu muugima, kwa lagilizo dyake vint'hu vikalile havihali vikuwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibulahimu katogola, ingwa mbuli yenyewe ikala ndala kutogola ili adahe kuwa tata wa isi nyingi gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga, “Weleko wako nauwe mwingi gesa nt'hondo za kuulanga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Chipindi icho Ibulahimu kakala mulala wa haguhi na myaka mia, mbali kutogola kwake hakuhungukile ingawa kakala akumanya kuwa mtufi wake ukala gesa udanganika na vilavila mkake Sala kakala mgumba. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ibulahimu akagendelela kutogola chila achilongile Mulungu na akapata nguvu muukutogola kwake na akamwink'ha hewala Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ibulahimu akamanya kuwa, kweli Mulungu akudaha kuyatenda yala alongile naamtendele. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ivo, kwa kutogola kwake nio kumtendile Mulungu amuone Ibulahimu kadamana halongozi hake. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Elo, mbuli zino zikulongigwa kuwa, “Mulungu kamtogola Ibulahimu kuwa kadamana halongozi hake.” Mbuli zino haziandikwe kwaajili ya Ibulahimu muhala, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />bali vilavila mbuli zino ni zetu cheye chose chimtogole Mulungu ila ambwelezile Mndewa wetu Yesu muugima. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Mulungu kamulava Yesu akomigwe kwaajili ya zambi chitendile na kambweleza muugima ili chidamane kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa na nt'hindiwalo na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Elo, kwavila chitogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa nzila ya kutogola, ivo china nt'hindiwalo na Mulungu kufosela Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa kumtogola Yesu, Mulungu kachinkha ujomwa wake. Hata aluse chikugendelela kukala muujomwa uo. Ivo chikudenkhelela nkhani, kwavila chikulolela kuwa nachikale hamwe na ukulu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Sio ayo muhala chikudenk'helela, bali vilavila chikudenk'helela muna mahenyeko kwavila chikumanya kuwa mahenyeko yakuchitenda chiwe wafinyilizi. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Ufinyilizi ukuchitenda chigangamale na ugangamavu ukuchitenda chiwe na lolelo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Lolelo dino sio dya kuchiguma chinyala, kwavila Mulungu kachigidila ubwedo wake mmyoyo yetu kufosela Muhe wake achink'hile. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ivochikalile hachikudaha kuihonya wenyewe kwa chipindi chitogoligwe, Kilisito akadanganika kwaajili ya cheye chili na zambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ni ndala mnt'hu yoyote kudanganika kwaajili ya mnt'hu ajomwane halongozi ha Mulungu, mbali mnt'hu akudaha kugeza kudanganika kwaajili ya mnt'hu adamane. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Mbali Mulungu kalagisa kuwa akuchibweda nk'hani, kwavila ivochikalile chink'hali china zambi, Kilisito akadanganika kwaajili yetu. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ivo kwavila haluse chitogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kufosela damu ya Kilisito. Ivo ikulagisa kuwa nachihonyigwe kulawa muna maya ya Mulungu kufosela yeye? <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Kwavila ivochikalile wanongwa wa Mulungu, chitendigwa kuwa wambuya zake kufosela kudanganika kwa mwanake, Vino chikawa wambuya wa Mulungu ivo nachihonyigwe kwavila Mulungu ni mgima. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Sio ayo muhala, mbali vilavila chikundenk'helela kwa ayala atendile Mulungu kufosela Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, achitendile kaidi chiwe wambuya wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu kachigalila kudanganika na Kilisito kachigalila ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Zambi iingila muna isi kwa kufosela mnt'hu imwe, nayo ikachigalila kudanganika na kudanganika kukaenela kwa want'hu wose kwavila wose watenda zambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Zambi ikala iyaho mui isi Malagilizo hayanalavigwa mui isi, zambi ikala iyaho, mbali ikawa habule malagilizo zambi haikumanyika kuwa zambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Mbali kuandusa chipindi cha Adamu hadi chipindi cha Musa kudanganika kukala kutalamila kwa want'hu wose, hata wala hawatendile zambi ya kumuleka Mulungu na ila aitendile Adamu ya kumuleka Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu kakala mulinganyo wa ila akulonda kwiza. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Mbali uhasanyi wa Adamu haukudaha kuliganyizigwa na ujomwa wa Mulungu, hata ikawa zambi ya mnt'hu imwe itenda want'hu wengi wadanganike, mbali kwa ujomwa wa mnt'hu imwe yaani Yesu Kilisito Mulungu kawaongezela want'hu ujomwa wake na chitumetume chake. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Chitumetume cha Mulungu hachikulingana na zambi ya mnt'hu imwe, kwavila ulamuzi wiza kufosela kwa mnt'hu imwe na ikachigalila henyeko, mbali chitumetume cha Mulungu chiza kwa nzila ya uhasanyi mwingi chiutendile, na ikatenda Mulungu achihalavile zambi zetu. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kweli, kwa uhasanyi wa mnt'hu imwe, want'hu wakaandusa kudanganika kwa kufosela mnt'hu imwe. Mbali ikulagisa kuwa chila achitendile ila mnt'hu imwe yaani Yesu kilisito ni chikulu nk'hani. Want'hu wose wakuhokela ujomwa uo na kitumetume icho cha kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu nawatalamile muugima kufosela mnt'hu imwe nae ni Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Gesavila zambi ya mnt'hu imwe ivo igalile ulamuzi kwa want'hu wose vilavila kwa mbuli idamane aitendile mnt'hu imwe ikuwenk'ha wose kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu na kupata ugima. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kwa mnt'hu imwe kuleka kumuhulika Mulungu, want'hu wengi watendigwa kuwa wana zambi. Ivoivo kwa mnt'hu imwe amuhulikile Mulungu itenda want'hu wengi watogolwe halongozi ha Mulungu kwa mnt'hu imwe, kumuhulika Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Malagilizo ya Musa ivoyalawile, yakagala kuongezekela kwa zambi, mbali zambi ivoiyongezekele wende wa Mulungu ukaiyoha kuongezekela. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Gesavila zambi ivoikalile na nguvu na kuwagalila want'hu kudanganika, ivoivo na ujomwa wa Mulungu ukuwatenda want'hu watogoligwe halongozi ha Mulungu na kuwagalila ugima wa siku zose kufosela Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kudanganika muna zizambi na kukala hamwenga na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Elo chilongeki? Vino, chigendelele kutenda zambi ili ujomwa wa Mulungu wongezeke? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Bule! Kwa mbuli ya zambi cheye chidanganika muna zizambi, vino chikudahaze kugendelela kaidi kukala mzambi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Egu, hammanyile kuwa cheye chose chibatizigwa muna Kilisito Yesu, chibatizigwa muna mukudanganika kwake? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ivo chibatizigwe chizikigwa hamwenga nae ili gesa vila Kilisito ivoabwelile muugima, kwa nguvu za ukulu wa tata, ivoivo na cheye chidahe kukala muna ugima mpya. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kwavila ikawa chiiyunga hamwe nae muukudanganika kwake, vilavila naachiyunge nae gesa vila yeye ivoabwelile muugima. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Chikumanya kuwa unt'hu wetu wa umwaka udanganika na kuhenyezwa hamwenga na Kilisito mumsalaba, ili nguvu ya zambi ibanangwe, chileke kuwa watwana wa zambi kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kwavila mnt'hu yoyote akadanganika gesa ivo hamwenga na Kilisito, kaambuligwa kulawa mzizambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ivo, ikawa chidanganika hamwenga na Kilisito, ivila chikutogola kuwa nachikale hamwenga nae. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Kwavila, chikumanya kuwa Kilisito kabwelezigwa kale muugima na sekeadanganike kaidi. Ivo kudanganika sekekumtalamile kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Kilisito ivo adanganikile kadanganika mala lumwe muhala, na kaihuma nguvu ya zambi na kukala kwake akukala kwa kubwedeza Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ivoivo na mweye mkulondigwa muione kuwa gesa mdanganika kwa mbuli ya zambi, mbali muione muwagima muna kuiyunga na Mulungu kwa kumtogola Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ivoelo, msekutogola zambi italamile kaidi mmitufi yenu ikudanganika na muleke kukola mitufi yenu ivo ikulonda. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Msekulava hata mp'hingili ya mitufi yenu iwe kinthu cha kutendela. Mbali ilaveni mweye wenyewe kwa Mulungu gesa want'hu mbwelezigwe muugima. Ilaveni mweye wenyewe kwa Mulungu gesa want'hu wabwelezigwe muugima kwa kuzitenda mbuli zidamane. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Zambi isekuwatalamila kaidi, kwavila hamkutalamilwa na Malagilizo, mbali mkutalamilwa na ujomwa wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watwana wa kutenda mbuli zikumbwedeza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Chilongeki? Vino, chitende zambi, kwavila hachikutalamilwa na malagilizo mbali chikutalamilwa na ujomwa wa Mulungu? Bule! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Vino, hamkumanya kuwa mkailava kwa mnt'hu yoyote gesa watwana mweye ni watwana wa mnt'hu iyo? Mkawa watwana wa zambi mbuli ikulonda kulawila ni kudanganika, na mkawa watwana wa kumuhulika Mulungu mbuli ikulonda kulawila ni kutogoligwa halongozi hake. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Umwaka mweye mkala watwana wa zambi, mbali aink'higwe hewala Mulungu, kwavila haluse mtogola kwa myoyo yenu yose kukola mafunzo muyahokele. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Mkomboligwa kulawa muutwana wa zambi, muwa wasank'hani wa mbuli zidamane. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nilonga na mweye kufosela mulinganyo wa mtwana ili mmanye icho hulonga, umwaka mkala watwana wa zambi kwa kuilava mweye wenyewe kuwa via va kutenda mbuli zihile, na zambi zenu zikaongezekela nkhani. Mbali haluse mkulondigwa muilave kwa Mulungu muukukala kwenu kose ili mtende yala yakulonda kulagisa kuwa mweye ni wanthu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ivomkalile watwana wa zambi, hamgesile kutenda mbuli zidamane halongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Vino, mpataki kwa kuzitenda mbuli zila haluse mkuziona chinyala? Mbuli izo uhelelo wake ni kudanganika! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Mbali haluse mulekeligwa kulawa muutwana wa zambi na muwa wasank'hani wa Mulungu, na muwa want'hu wake na nkhomelezo yake ni ugima wa siku zose. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ukaisank'hanila zambi iko kikulonda kulawila ni kudanganika, mbali kitumetume cha Mulungu ni ugima wa siku zose kufosela Kilisito Yesu, Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulinganyo wa zengele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ndugu zangu, humanya namuyakombaganye yano hulonda kuyalonga, kwavila humanya hulonga na want'hu wayamanyile Malagilizo. Malagilizo yakumtalamila mnt'hu hala akawa mgima. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Gesavila, Mwanamke asoligwe akutalamilwa na malagilizo hala mulumake akawa mgima. Mbali mulumake akadanganika mwanamke iyo hakutalamwa mbwi na malagilizo ya zengele. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ivoelo, ikawa mwanamke iyo akasoligwa na mwanamulume imwenga na kuno mulumake mgima naatangigwe muhank'hu. Mbali mulumake akadanganika mwanamke iyo hakutalamwa kaidi na malagilizo ya zengele na want'hu sekewamtange muhank'hu akasoligwa na mwanamulume imwenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Vilavila na mweye ndugu zangu, mulavigwa kulawa muutwana wa malagilizo ya umwaka ivomdanganikile hamwenga na Kilisiyo. Haluse ninyi ni want'hu wa Kilisto. Chose ni want'hu wa Kilisito ili chitende yala yakumbwedeza Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Kwavila ivochikalile chikukala gesa want'hu ivo wakukala, nk'hwina ya kutenda zambi ikalile ikusongezigwa na malagilizo, ikala ikusank'hana mmitufi yetu, na nk'homelezo yake ingi chihelele muukudanganika. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Umwaka chikala chifungigwa na Malagilizo, mbali haluse chidanganika hamwenga na Kilisito, ivo chifunguligwa kulawa Mmalagilizo. Elo hachikumsank'hanila Mulungu kwa kutoza Malagilizo yaandikigwe, bali chikumsank'hanila Mulungu kwa nzila mpya ya kulongozigwa na Muhe wake.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo na zambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Elo chilonge bwani, vino malagilizo ni zambi? Bule! Bali kufosela malagilizo yanidahiza nimanye zambi ni chint'hu cha vilihi. Gesa malagilizo ingi hayalongile, “Use kumelela mate chint'hu cha miyago.” Silondile kumanya kumelela mate ni chint'hu cha vilihi. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Mbali ivonidimanyile lagilizo dino, zambi ipata nzila ya kunitenda niinukilwe kumelela mate kila chint'hu kihile mgati yangu. Kwavila kukawa kubule malagilizo, zambi ikuwa chint'hu chidanganike. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Umwaka ivonikalile siyamanyile malagilizo nikala hukala ivohulonda. Mbali ivoniyamanyile malagilizo, nio nikamanya kuwa nie nitenda zambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Nie nimanya kuwa yala malagilizo yalondigwe kugala ugima, kumwangu nie yatenda nilamuligwe kudanganika. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ivoelo zambi ikanihunila nzila malagilizo ayo na ikanitenda nidanganike. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ivoelo, ikulagisa Malagilizo yalawa kwa Mulungu. Malagilizo ayo yadamana na ya gesa ivo ikulonigwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Vino, ino ikulagisa kuwa kila nikionile kidamana kigaluka na kinigalila ulamuzi wa kudanganika? Bule! Mbali ili zambi itangigwe zambi ikufosela kila kidamane na kunigalila kudanganika kwangu. Ivo Malagilizo yakulagisa kweli zambi ivo ihile nk'hani.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyutana kwili mgati mwa mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Chikumanya kuwa Malagilizo ni ya Kimuhe, mbali nie sio mnt'hu wa Kimuhe, niguligwa niwe mtwana wa zambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Sichimanyile icho huchitenda, kwavila kila hulonda kuchitenda sikuchitenda, mbali kila sikuchilonda nio huchitenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ivo, ikawa hutenda yala sikuyalonda, ikulagisa kuwa nikuyatogola kuwa yala malagilizo yadamana. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Sio nie hulonda kutenda mbuli zihile, mbali zambi ila ikukala imgati yangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Humanya kuwa mgati mwa mtufi wangu mbule mbuli yoyote idamane ikukala, kwavila ingawa hulonda kutenda mbuli idamane mbali sikudaha kuitenda.<verse eid="ROM 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ivo, sikudaha kuitenda mbuli idamane ila hulonda kuitenda, mbali ila mbuli ihile sikulonda kuitenda ndo huitenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ikawa huzitenda mbuli zila sikuzilonda kuzitenda, mbuli iyo ikulagisa kuwa sio nie huzitenda mbuli izo, mbali ni ila zambi ikukala mgati yangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ivo, niitola mbuli ino, hulonda kutenda mbuli zidamane, mbali huifika nisagula mbuli ila ihile sikuilonda. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mgati muumoyo wangu hudenk'helela Malagilizo ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Mbali huona kuwa kuna malagilizo yamwenga yakusank'hana mumtufi wangu, malagilizo ayo yakunyutana na magesa yangu yadamane, Malagilizo ayo yakutenda niwe mtwana wa zambi ikukala mgati mmwangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mbuli ino ikunitenda nisekuwa na denk'ho! Vino, niyani naanihonye kulawa mumtufi uno ukunigala mukudanganika?<verse eid="ROM 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Mbali, chimwink'he hewala Mulungu, achihonyile kufosela Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kwa ivonili, umanyi wangu ukusank'hanila Malagilizo ya Mulungu. Mbali mtufi wangu ukusank'hanila mbuli za zambi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ugima Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ivoelo, haluse kubule kulamuligwa kwa wala wose waiyungile na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwavila, Lagilizo da Muhe wa ugima ila akupatika kufosela Kilisito Yesu, inilava mvifungo vya malagilizo ya zambi na kudanganika. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mulungu katenda mbuli ila Lagilizo dipotigwe kutenda, kwavila kiunt'hu cheye chibule nguvu. Mulungu kamulagiliza mwanake akawa gesa mnt'hu eli na mtufi gesa cheye ivo chili ili aihume zambi kufosela mtufi wake. Kwa mtufi wake uo kawa nt'hambiko ya kuchihalavila zambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Mulungu katenda ivo ili chitende vila malagilizo ivo yakulonda, ili chidahe kumuhulika Muhe wa Mulungu, wala kukola mitufi ivoikulonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kwavila wala wakukala kwa kukola mtufi ivoukulonda, ao wakugesa mtufi ivo ukulonda, mbali wala wakukala kwa kukola Muhe wa Mulungu ivoukulonda, ao wakugesa Muhe wa Mulungu ivoukulonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Want'hu wakutalamilwa na magesa ya mtufi, yakuwatenda wadanganike, mbali want'hu wakutalamilwa na Muhe wa Mulungu wakuwa na ugima na nt'hindiwalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ila akulongozwa na magesa ya mtufi ni mnongwa wa Mulungu, kwavila hakudaha kuyakola malagilizo ya Mulungu, kweli hakudaha kuyatoza. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ivo, wose wala wakukola mitufi ivoikulonda, hawakudaha kumbwedeza Mulungu vila akulonda.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Mweye hamkutalamwa na mtufi mbali mkutalamilwa na Muhe wa Mulungu ikawa akukala mgati yenu. Mnt'hu yoyote akawa abule Muhe wa Kilisito, iyo hakuwa mnt'hu wa Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Mbali ikawa Kilisito akukala mgati yenu, mitufi yenu naiwe gesa idanganika kwa mbuli zambi, mbali mihe yenu ni migima kulawana na kutogoligwa kwenu halongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Namweye mkawa na Muhe wa Mulungu ila ambwelezile Yesu muugima akukala mgati mmwenu, yeye ambwelezile Yesu muugima ivila nawabwelezele ugima mitufi yenu ila ikudanganika kufosela Muhe wake ila akukala mgati yenu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ivoelo, ndugu zangu china sank'hano ya kutenda, hachikulondigwa kukala kwa kukola mitufi yetu ivo ikulonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwavila mkakala kwa kuikola mitufi ivo ikulonda, kweli namdanganike. Mbali kufosela Muhe mkayakoma yala yehile yakutendigwa na mtufi, namkale wagima. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Want'hu wose wakutalamilwa na Muhe wa Mulungu ao nio wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kwa Muhe ila awenk'hile Mulungu hakuwatenda mweye muwe watwana na woga, mbali kwa Muhe iyo mweye muwa wana wa Mulungu, na kwa kufosela Muhe iyo cheye chikumtanga Mulungu, “Abba.” Uko nio kulonga “Tata.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Muhe wa Mulungu akaiyunga na mihe yetu, akuchitenda chimanye kuwa kweli cheye ni wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ivo, kwavila cheye ni wana wa Mulungu, nachihokele mbuli zidamane za Mulungu awaikile want'hu wake, na nachihokele mbuli izo hamwenga na Kilisito, kweli, chikahenyezigwa hamwenga na Kilisito, vilavila nachipate ukulu hamwenga nae.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu ukwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mahenyeko yetu ya haluse, sikuyawaza gesa ni chint'hu cha kulinganiza na ukulu wa Mulungu ula ukulonda kulagisigwa kumwetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Kwavila vint'hu vose viumbigwe na Mulungu vikugozela nk'hani kulagisigwa kuwa wana wa Mulungu ni wali. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kwavila viumbe vose vikala havikufaya, mbali si kwa kubweda kwawe, mbali Mulungu mwenyewe nio abwedile iwe ivo, mbali lolelo diyaho. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Kwavila viumbe ivo navo navihonywe kulawa muna utwana wa ubananzi, na naviikigwe muna utunyo wa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Kwavila chikumanya hadi haluse, viumbe vose vikuugulila kwa usungu, gesa usungu wa mwanamke kuvumbula mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Mbali sio ivo muhala vikuugulila, na cheye vilavila chili na Muhe wa Mulungu chikuugulila mgati yetu, mbali chikulolela kukomboligwa mitufi yetu na kutedigwa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwavila kwa lolelo idyo na cheye chihonyigwa. Mbali lolelo dibule mana ikawa chila chikukilolela chikuchiona. Vino niani naalolele kuchipata chint'hu eli nacho kale? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ivo chikachilolela chint'hu hachina kipata, nachichigozele kwa kufinyiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ivila, cheye chibule udahi, mbali Muhe wa Mulungu akwiza akuchitaza muukuhungukilwa kwetu. Kwavila hachikumanya kulomba vila akulonda Mulungu, mbali Muhe mwenyewe akuchilombela kwa Mulungu kwa kugutilila kwa usungu ula haukusimulilwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Nae Mulungu akuona mgati mmiyoyo ya want'hu, akumanya vila Muhe akuwaza, kwavila iyo Muhe akuwalombela kwa Mulungu kwa kukola Mulungu ivoakulonda.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Na cheye chikumanya kuwa mzimbuli zose, Mulungu akusank'hana hamwe na wala wakumbweda na kuwenk'ha yadamane, wala awatangile kuitenda sank'hano yake. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Want'hu wala Mulungu awasagulile tangu haumwanduso awo nio awaikile wawe wake gesa ivoeli mwanake, ili mwanake awe muelekwa wa mwanduso hagati ha want'hu wengi wamtogole Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Na wala aandusile kuwasagula, ao nio kawatanga, na wala awatangile, ao nio awatogole halongozi hake, na wala watogoligwe halongozi hake, ao nio awenk'hile ukulu.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubwedo wa Mulungu kufosela Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ivo, chilongeki muna ayano? Mulungu akawa ubanzi wetu niyani akudaha kuchilemela? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ikawa Mulungu hamulemesile Mwanake na akamulava kwaajili yetu cheye chose, vino, naapotigweze kuchink'ha cheye chint'hu chochote icho chikulonda kumulomba? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Vino, niani akulonda kuwalaha want'hu wasagulwe na Mulungu? Kwavila Mulungu mwenyewe nio akulonda kuwatogola halongozi hake. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Vino, niyani akulonda kuwalamula? Ikawa Kilisito Yesu nio adanganike na nio abwelile muugima na akukala ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu. Nae nio akuchilombela cheye. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Niani akudaha kuchibagula na ubwedo wa Kilisito? Vino, magayo egu ziki, egu mahenyeko egu nzala egu sakaza egu nk'hondo egu kudanganika? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Gesa Mandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga kuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwaajili yako chikulondigwa kukomigwa ichilo na msanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">kwavila chikuwaziligwa gesa ngoto wakulondigwa kuchinjigwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Mbali muna zimbuli zose cheye chikuhuma uhumi mkulu, kwa kutazigwa na Yesu Kilisito ila achibwedile. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kwavila nimanya kale kuwa habule chint'hu chikudaha kuchibagula na ubwedo wa Mulungu. Sio kudanganika, wala ugima, wala wasank'hani wa Kuulanga egu nguvu zimwenga za kuulanga wala yala yakulonda kulawila vino haluse, wala yala yakulonda kulawila sihakwe, wala ukulu, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />wala yala yeli mchanya, wala yala yeli hasi, wala chiumbe chimwenga chochote hachikudaha kuchibagula na ubwendo wa Mulungu uli mgati ya Kilisito Yesu Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu na want'hu wake wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Hulonga kweli, nie ni mnt'hu wa Kilisito, na sikuhuna mbwi. Na Moyo wangu ukalongozwa na Muhe wa Mulungu ukulagisa mbuli ino. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nilonge kweli kuwa nina chiholo na mahenyeko makulu hayakumala mmoyo mmwangu, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />kwavila nilonda hata nie nibanangikilwe na kutengigwa na Kilisito kwaajili ya kuwataza want'hu wa kabila dyangu. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Want'hu ao nio Waizilaeli wala Mulungu awasagule wawe wanake, kawagubulila ukulu wake, wakatenda malagano na akawenk'ha Malagilizo yake, na utogozi wa kweli na mbuli alongile nazitende. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Ao Waizilaile nio wazukulu wa Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, nae Kilisito muna unt'hu wake, kalawa muulukolo wawe. Mulungu nio akulongoza vint'hu vose na atunyigwe siku zose bila nk'himelezo! Tawile.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Sikulonga kuwa Mulungu kapotigwa kutenda yala alongile naatende. Kwavila ni Waizilaeli wadodo nio wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Hawakuwa weleko wa Ibulahimu kwavila waelekigwa nae, mbali gesa Mandiko ivoyakulonga kuwa, “Weleko wako naulawane na Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ino ni kulonga kuwa, sio want'hu wose waelekigwe gesa wamwenga ivo wakwelekigwa ao nio wana wa Mulungu, mbali ni wala waelekwe kwa kukola kila alongile Mulungu ao nio wakuwazigwa kuwa wana wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Kwavila mbuli ailongile Mulungu ni ino, “Mwaka ukwiza chipindi gesa chino nanibwele, na iyo mkako Sala naeleke mwana wa chilume.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Vilavila sio ayo muhala, mbali vilavila Lebeka nae kwa beleko dimwe akaeleka wana waidi wachilume wa tata imwe, yaani Isaka, wasaho wetu. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Mbali, ili Mulungu aoneke kuwa hakukikizigwa kusagula, hata wala wamwenga hawanaelekigwa na hata hawanamanya didamane na dihile, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Lebeka kalongeligwa kuwa ila mwana andusile kwelekwa namsank'hanile ila akomeleze kwelekwa. Ivo ikulagisa kuwa Mulungu akuwasagula want'hu kulawana nayeye ivoakulonda, na sio kukola vila want'hu ivowakulonda. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga, “Yakobo nimbweda, mbali Esau simbwedile.” <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ivo, chilongeki? Vino, Mulungu akutenda yehile? Bule! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Kwavila kamulongela Musa, “Nanimuonele ubazi mnt'hu yoyote hulonda nimuonele ubazi na nanimuone ubazi mnt'hu yoyote hulonda kumuonela ubazi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ivo, yose yakusigamila ubazi wa Mulungu na si kwa kukola vila akulonda mnt'hu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Kwavila Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga vino kwa mbuli ya Falao, “Nikutenda mwene ili kufosela weye nilagise ukulu wangu, na zina dyangu dilongigwe muna isi zose.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ivoelo, Mulungu akumuonela ubazi mnt'hu yoyote ila akulonda kumuonela ubazi, na akalonda kumtenda mnt'hu awe na moyo mdala akudaha kutenda ivo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maya ya Mulungu na ubazi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ivoelo nauniuze, “Ikawa mbuli izo ziivo, hangi Mulungu akulonga cheye chihasanya? Vino, niani akulonda kulema yala akuyalonda Mulungu?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Mbali weye mnt'hu ukuiyona niani hata ukugeza kumuuza Mulungu? Vino, nongo ikudaha kumuuza ila aiumbile, “Hangi kuniumba vino?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kwa ulongo ulaula, ila mnt'hu akuumba nongo akudaha kuumba ulongo vila akulonda? Ena, akudaha kuumba vinongo vidi chimwenga chikutunywa nk'hani na chimwenga hanyikutunyigwa nk'hani.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ivo nivo vili kwa Mulungu. Kalonda kulagisa maya yake na kuchitenda chimanye nguvu zake, ivo kakala akuwagozela na kuwafinyiliza want'hu wala waikigwe kufikana na maya ya Mulungu, want'hu ao ni wala wakalile wakulondigwa kukomigwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Vilavila Mulungu kalonda kulagisa wingi wa ukulu wake, ula achigidilile cheye chikalile chikulondigwa kuonelwa ubazi nae, cheye achisasalile kuhokela ukulu wake. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Kwavila cheye nio ao achitangile, si kulawa kwa Wayahudi muhala, mbali vilavila kulawa kwa want'hu sio Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Kwavila nivo iyandikigwe mchitabu cha Hosea mulotezi wa Mulungu, Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Wala wakalile Sio want'hu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Naniwatange, want'hu wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Nao want'hu wakalile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">sikuwabweda, haluse huwabweda.”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Ivo, na hant'hu hala walongigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">“Mweye sio want'hu wangu aho nawatangwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Wana wa Mulungu eli na ugima.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Nae Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya Izilaeli akalonga kwa sauti nk'hulu, akalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">“Hata ikawa want'hu waizilaeli ni wengi gesa msenga wa mpwani, mbali niwadodo nawahonyigwe, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />kwavila Mndewa naatende hima ulamuzi wake kwa isi yose.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Gesavila Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu ivo alongile aho umwaka, “Mndewa eli na nguvu ingi halondile kuchilekela wamwenga wa weleko wa wana wa Izilaeli, ingi chidanganike gesa want'hu wa Sodoma na Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wakulema kumtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Vino, chilongeki? Want'hu sio Wayahudi wakalile hawalondile kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu, haluse wakutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa kutogola. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Mbali want'hu wa Izilaeli wakalile wakuhunganika kulonda kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa nzila ya Lagilizo, ao hawapatile. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Hangi hawatogoligwe halongozi ha Mulungu? Hawatogoligwe Kwavila wakala hawakulonda kwa nzila ya kutogola mbali wakala wakuilonda kwa nzila ya mbuli wakalile wakuzitenda. Ivo wakaikwala “mdiibwe kulu wakagwa.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Gesavila Maandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Lola, hudiika muna Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">ibwe da kuikwala na talawe da kuwatenda want'hu wagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">mbali mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumtogola Mulungu seke agumwe chinyala mbwi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ndugu zangu, icho huchilonda mmoyo wangu na kuchilomba kwa Mulungu ni Waizilaeli wayangu wahonyigwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Huwalongeleni kweli, want'hu ao wakuilava nk'hani kumulonda Mulungu, mbali kumulonda kwao Mulungu hakukufaya. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Kwavila hawamanyile Mulungu ivoakuwatenda want'hu watogoligwe halongozi hake. Nao wakaandusa kugeza kukola nzila yawe wenyewe, wailema nzila ya Mulungu ya kuwatenda want'hu watogoligwe halongozi hake. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ivo kwiza kwa Kilisito kuyatenda malagilizo yawe sio chint'hu cha kusegamiligwa haukutogoligwa want'hu halongozi ha Mulungu, mbali want'hu wakutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa kumtogola Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhonyi ni kwaajili ya want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Kwa mbuli iyo ya mnt'hu kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa kukola Malagilizo, Musa kandika vino, “Mnt'hu yoyote akatenda vila malagilizo yakulonda, naakale vila malagilizo yakulonda.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Mbali kula kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu kwa nzila ya kutogola, kukulonga vino, “Usekulonga mumoyo wako, niyani naakwele kuulanga?” Kulonga ivo kulinga gesa, kumgala Kilisito hano hai isi. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Wala usekulonga “Niyani naatelemke hadi kuzimu?” Uko nio kulonga, kumbweleza muugima Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Hata ivo Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga vino, “Mbuli ya Mulungu ihaguhi naweye, immumlomo mwako na immoyo mmwako.” Mbuli iyo nio ila chikalile chikuilonga. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Kwavila ukalonga mmulomo mmwako, “Yesu ni Mndewa.” Na ukatogola mmoyo mmwako kuwa Mulungu kambweleza mugima, nauhonyeke. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwavila mnt'hu akatogola kwa moyo wake, akutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu, na mnt'hu akatogola na kulonga kwa mulomo wake, naahonyeke. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Mandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga vino, “Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumtogola Yesu sekeagumigwe chinyala.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Habule mbuli ikulonda kuwabagula hagati ya Wayahudi na want'hu sio Wayahudi, kwavila Mulungu ni Mulungu wa want'hu wose, nae akuwataza want'hu wose wakumulomba. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Gesa Mandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga, “Mnt'hu yoyote akulonda kumtanga Mndewa kwa kumulomba, naahonyigwe.” <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mbali nawamulombeze ila hawakumtogola? Na wadaheze kumtogola ikawa hawanahulika mbuli zake? Nawahulikeze bila ya mnt'hu wa kuwalongela? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Nao nawadaheze kulonga mbuli ya Mulungu bila kutumigwa? Gesa Mandiko ya Mulungu ivo yakulonga, “Ni mbuli yakubwedeza nk'hani kwiza kwa want'hu wakuilonga Mbuli Idamane!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Mbali sio want'hu wose hawaihokele Mbuli Idamane. Hata Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu kalonga, “Mndewa, niyani aitogolile nt'hume yetu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ivo, kutogola kukwandusa muukuhulika Mbuli Idamane, na Mbuli iyo Idamane ikwiza kwa kuhulika mbuli ya Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Mbali huuza, vino, want'hu ao hawahulike mbuli iyo? Ena, wahulika, gesa Mandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Want'hu walonga nt'hume ya Mulungu chila hant'hu mui isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">na want'hu wakahulika nt'hume ya Mulungu chila hant'hu mui isi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Huuza kaidi, vino, ikudahika kuwa want'hu wa Izilaeli wakala hawamanyile? Bule! Musa mwenyewe kalonga kuusu mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Naniwatende muwaonele miongo want'hu sio wa isi yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Naniwatende Waizilaeli waone maya kufosela want'hu hawakumanya chochote.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu akalonga bila kuogoha mbuli alongeligwe na Mulungu kuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Niilagisa kumwawe kwa want'hu wakalile hawakunilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">niwatenda wanimanye kumwawe want'hu hawaziuzile mbuli zangu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Mbali kwa mbuli ya Waizilaeli, Mulungu kalonga, “Msanya wose niwagololela mikono yangu kuwahokela want'hu hawakuhulika na hawakutogola.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ubazi wa Mulungu kwa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Elo huuza, vino, Mulungu kawalema want'hu wake? Bule! Niye mwenyewe ni Muizilaeli, mwelekwa wa Ibulahimu, kulawa mdikabila da Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Mulungu hawalemile want'hu wake awasagulile tangu mwanduso. Vino, hamkukumbuka vila mandiko yakulonga, vila Eliya alalame halongozi ha Mulungu kwa mbuli ya Waizilaeli? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Hala alongile, “Mndewa, wawakoma walotezi wako na wahatula hant'hu hako hakulavila nt'hambiko, nisigala nie nidumwe nao wakulonda kunikoma.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Mbali Mulungu akamlongela, “Niisigazila want'hu wangu elufu saba ao hawana mfugamalila Baali wamtangile Mulungu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Vilavila nivo vili hata haluse, weyaho want'hu chidogo wasaguligwa kwa ujomwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Mulungu kawasagula want'hu kulawana na ujomwa wake, nasio kwa mbuli wazitendile want'hu. Kwavila ge Mulungu ingi asagule kwa kulola chila want'hu wakuchitenda, ingi ujomwa wake haulondile kuwa ujomwa kaidi. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Vino, want'hu wa Izilaeli hawapatile chila wakalile wakuchilonda? Bule, mbali wasaguligwe wakala wachipata na wamwenga wasigale watendigwa wasekumanya nt'hume ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga, “Mulungu kawatenda wanthu ao gesa want'hu wagonile, hadi vino haluse akutenda ivo hawakudaha kuona kwa meso yawe wala kuhulika kwa magutwi yawe.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Nae Mwene Daudi akalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Ndia za shelehe zawe za kudya ziwe mitego ya kuwagwila, na chint'hu cha kuwatenda wagwe na kulamuligwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Meso yawe yagelwe ziza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Ili yapotwe kuona, na migongo yawe iveduke kwa mahenyeko ya siku zose.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ivo huuza, vino, Wayahudi ivo waikwalile na kulagala seke wainuke kaidi? Bule! Mbali kwa kumulema muhonyi, uhonyi wita kwa want'hu wa isi zimwenga, ili Wayahudi waone miongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Mbali zambi ya Wayahudi iwatenda want'hu wa isi zimwenga wawe na balaka nk'hulu mui isi, na kuhasanya kwawe kwa kimuhe kugala balaka nk'hulu kwa want'hu sio Wayahudi. Iyo, ikulagisa kuwa ikawa Wayahudi wengi wakamtogola Yesu, want'hu wa isi zimwenga nawapae balaka nk'hulu nk'hani.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhonyi wa want'hu sio Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Haluse hulonga na mweye sio Wayahudi. Kwavila nie ni nitumigwa kwa want'hu weli si Wayahudi, huigodela sank'hano yangu, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />nidahe kuwatenda Wayahudi wayangu waonele miyongo, ili wamwenga hagati ya ao Wayahudi wadahe kuhonyigwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ikawa kwa kulemwa kwawe kutenda want'hu sio Wayahudi watogoligwe na Mulungu. Vino, naiweze Mulungu akawatogola Wayahudi halongozi hake? Naiwe gesa Want'hu wabwelezigwe muugima!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ikawa chibenzu cha mwanduso cha mgate chilavigwa halongozi ha Mulungu, mgate wose ukuwa wa Mulungu. Ikawa maizi ya mti yakalavigwa kwa Mulungu, mti wose ukuwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Na matambi yamwenga ya mzeituni wa mumgunda yakant'hwa na hant'hu hala hakant'higwe dikahota tambi da mzeituni mbago. Mweye want'hu mwili sio Wayahudi nio mkulingana na tambi idyo da mzeituni mbago, na haluse mkupata ndia ili na ugima kufosela mzaituni uhandigwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ivo, muleke kuyazela matambi yala yakant'higwe! Hata ikawa kuna mbuli ya kuigodela, msekuzimiza kuwa sio mweye mkuyatozeleza maizi, mbali maizi nio yakuwatozeleza mweye.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Mbali mkudaha kulonga, “Matambi yakant'higwa ili nihandigwe nie.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ena, yakant'higwa kwavila hayatogole, mbali mweye mtimalala kwa kutogola kwako. Elo muiteganye muleke kuigoda. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ikawa Mulungu hawaonele ubazi Wayahudi wala wakalile gesa matambi ya mwanduso ya mzeituni, vino, mkumanya nawaonele ubazi mweye? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Elo lola, Mulungu ivo eli na ubazi na ivo eli mkali. Yeye ni mkali kwa wala wagwile na akuwa kadamana kumwako weye, ukawa ukugendelela kumtogola mbali mkaleka kugendelela kumtogola, naweye vilavila naukant'hwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Nao Wayahudi vilavila, wakatogola, Mulungu nawaikwe hant'hu hala wakant'higwe, kwavila Mulungu akudaha kutenda ivo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mweye want'hu wa isi zimwenga mkulingana na mzeituni wambago, mbali mlavigwa uko, mkahandikizwa mumzeituni uhandigwe hant'hu hakalile sio henu. Mbali Wayahudi wakala gesa mzeituni uhandigwe mumgunda, ivo naidahike kwa ao kuhandikizwa kaidi mumti wawe.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu akuwaonela ubazi Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ndugu zangu, hulonda mmanye ukweli uno ufisike, msekuiona kuwa muna umanyi nk'hani. Kutokutogola kwa Wayahudi kukala kwa chipindi chidodo, hadi hala want'hu sio Wayahudi wakulonda kumtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Aho nio want'hu wose Waizilaeli nawahonyige, gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Muhonyi naeze kulawa bululu da Sayuni, naausegeze uhasanyi wose wa weleko wa Yakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Dino ndo lagano dyangu hulonda kuditenda kumwawe chipindi nikeza kuzisegeza zambi zawe.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwavila wakuilema Mbuli Idamane, Wayahudi wawa wanongwa wa Mulungu, mbali kwa mbuli ya kusaguligwa kwawe, ao ni wambuya wa Mulungu kwaajili ya wasaho zawe. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Kwavila Mulungu akawasagula want'hu na kuwenkha chitumetume hakubiduka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Aho hamwanduso mweye want'hu wa isi zimwenga mkala hamkutenda yala akuyalonda Mulungu, mbali vino haluse mpata ubazi wa Mulungu kulawana na kulema kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Vilavila, na ao Wayahudi haluse wambiduka Mulungu ili kwa kuonelwa mweye ubazi na ao waonelwe ubazi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Kwavila Mulungu kawaleka want'hu wose walekile kumuhulika ili awaonele ubazi want'hu wose.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu atunyigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ena, Mulungu ana vint'hu vingi vijomwane na ni mkulu nk'hani! Umanyi wake na kumanya kwake kubule nk'homelezo! Habule mnt'hu akudaha kusimulila yala Mulungu akuyalamula. Habule mnthu akudaha kupelemba vila Mulungu akudaha kutenda mbuli zake. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Niani akuchimanya chila akuchiwaza Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Niani akudaha kumlongoza Mulungu muulamuzi wake?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Egu, niani amwink'hile Mulungu chint'hu chochote chimtendile ambwelezele na Mulungu?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwavila vint'hu vose vikulawa kumwake, vose vimudahi wake na kwaajili yake. Ukulu na uwe kumwake siku zose! Tawile.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kuilava kumsank'hanila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ivo ndugu zangu, kwavila Mulungu kachionela ubazi nk'hani, huwalombeni nk'hani ilaveni mweye wenyewe kwa Mulungu, muwe gesa nt'hambiko ili na ugima ila ya Mulungu na yakumbwedeza Mulungu. Vino nivo mkulondigwa kutenda kumfugamalila Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Lekeni kugesa gesa want'hu wa isi ino ivo wakugesa, mbali mbidulwe kwakutendigwa wapya mgati yenu, ili mdahe kuyamanya yala akuyalonda Mulungu na kumanya mbuli ikudamana ikumbwedeza na ikamilike halongozi hake.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwa ujomwa niink'higwe na Mulungu, hulonga na mweye mose, chila mnt'hu aleke kulonda mbuli nk'hulu kufosa ivo akulondigwa awe, muipime wenyewe gesa ivo mwili kwa utogozi ula Mulungu amwink'hile chila mnt'hu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Gesa ivomkumanya mtufi ni umwe na una mp'hingili nyingi, mbali chila mp'hingili ikutenda sank'hano yake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Vilavila na cheye, ingawa chiwengi, mbali chimtufi umwe kwa kuiyunga na Kilisito, na chila mnt'hu ni chimp'hingili cha miyage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ivo chila mnt'hu ana chitumetume chake kulawana na ujomwa wa Mulungu achink'hile. Eli na chitumetume cha ulotezi naalotele kwa kutogola kwake. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ila eli na udahi wa kusank'hana sankhano ya Mulungu naasank'hane. Eli na udahi wa kufunza naafunze. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ila eli na udahi wa kuwagela moyo wamwenga naatende ivo. Ila akudaha kuwenk'ha wamwenga vint'hu eli navo naatende ivo kwa kudenk'helela. Mtimalizi naatimalalile kwa kugangamala na ila ana moyo wakuwataza wayage naatende ivo kwa denk'ho.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Wabwedeni wayenu na ubwedo wenu uleke kuwa naubilikizi wowote. Ivo ikulondigwa mleke kutenda zambi, bali mtende mbuli zidamane siku zose. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mbwedane mweye kwa mweye gesa ndugu, kila mnt'hu amuone miage akufaya nk'hani. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Lekeni kuwa wavu muu kuisa, mbali msankanileni Mulungu kwa moyo wenu wosa. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Lolelo dyenu kufosela Mulungu uwatende mbwede, na mmahenyeko mfinyiliize na kugendelela kumulomba Mulungu siku zose. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Watazeni wayenu wakumtogola Kilisito gesa mweye vint'hu venu na muwahokele watafi kwa kudenk'helela.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Walombeleni yadamane wanongwa wenu ili Mulungu awenk'he yadamane na sio kuwenk'ha yehile. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Denk'heleleni hamwenga na wose wakudenk'helela, na lileni hamwenga na wala wakulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mkale goya mweye kwa mweye. Lekeni kuigoda kuwa mkumanya kuhuma wamwenga, mbali mtogole kukala na want'hu mbugilambugila. Lekeni kuiona kuwa mna umanyi nk'hani.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Mnt'hu akawatendeleni mbuli ihile, mweye msekumuliha mbuli ihile, mbali mtende yala want'hu wakuyamanya kuwa yadamana. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Mtende mbuli yoyote ila mkuidaha ili muwe na nt'hindiwalo na want'hu wose.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ndugu zangu mweye huwabwedeni, msekulihiza yehile, mbali mlekeleni Mulungu mbuli iyo, kwavila muna Maandiko ya Mulungu, Mulungu akulonga, “Mbuli ya kulihiza ni yangu nie.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Vilavila, Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga, “Mnongwa wako akawa na nzala, mwink'he ndia adye, akawa na nk'hilu mwik'he mazi ang'we. Ukatenda ivo, naumtende aone chinyala nk'hani.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Usekuhumwa na yehile, mbali yahume yehile kwa kutenda yadamane.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Muwahulike vilongozi wa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Chila mnt'hu akulondigwa awahulike vilongozi wa selikali, kwavila ulongozi wose ukulawa kwa Mulungu na vilongozi ao waikigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ivo mnt'hu yoyote akadilema lagizo da vilongozi wa selikali, kadilema lagilizo da Mulungu, na ao wakutenda ivo nawalamuligwe. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kwavila vilongozi hawakuogohwa na want'hu wala wakutenda mbuli zidamane, mbali wakuogohwa na wala want'hu wakutenda mbuli zihile, ivo ukalonda usekumuogoha kilongozi, ukulondigwa utende mbuli zidamane nae nakutunye. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Kwavila vilongozi wa selikali ni wasank'hani wa Mulungu wakusank'hana kwaajili ya kuwatazani mweye, mbali ukatenda mbuli zihile ogoha, kwavila vilongozi hawakulamula kukawa kubule ubananzi. Ao ni wasak'hani wa Mulungu na Mulungu akuwalamula wala wakutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ivo, mkulondigwa kuwategeleza vilongozi, mbali sio kwa kuogoha maya ya Mulungu, mbali kwavila mweye nio mkumanya kuwa Mulungu nio akubweda muwe mkutenda ivo.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kwaajili ya mbuli iyo mweye mkuliha kodi, kwavila vilongozi ni wasank'hani wa Mulungu, kwa vila siku zawe zose wakulongoza. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ivo, muliheni kila mnt'hu icho mkudaigwa, ikawa ni nt'haja liheni nt'haja, ikawa ushulu liheni ushulu, akulondigwa kuogohwa muogoheni.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwedana gesa ndugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mleke kudaigwa chint'hu chochote na mnt'hu mbali muibwede. Kwavila ila akumbweda miage akuwa kayatenda Malagilizo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Kwavila Malagilizo ayo yakulonga vino, “Usekutenda ugoni, Usekukoma, usekumelela mate.” Malagilizo yano na yamwenga yose yaikigwa mdilagilizo dimwe da, “Mbwede miago gesa ivoukuibweda weye.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ivo ukambweda miago hukudaha kumtendela miago mbuli ihile. Kwavila ubwedo ukutenda gesa Malagilizo ivoyakulagiliza. <verse eid="ROM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Namweye tendeni vino kwa kuchimanya chipindi chiwile nacho haluse, ni chipindi cha kuinuka mzint'hongo, kwavila uhonyi wetu uhaguhi nk'hani kufosa chipindi chila ivo chiandusile kumtogola Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Chilo chihaguhi na kucha, na lugunzu uhaguhi na kwingila. Ivo chileke kutenda mbuli zihile zila want'hu wakutenda mdiziza, chitende mbuli zidamane za muulumuli. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Siku zose chikulondigwa chikale goya, kwavila chikukala muulumuli wa msanya, na sio kwa kubunk'hanya, kung'wa upele, kulonda chila chint'hu chiwe chako, uhank'hu, ndwagi na miongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Badala ya kutenda mbuli zihile, mgese na mtende gesa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Usekumulamula miago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Muhokeleni ila eli na utogozi mdodo, na msekupinzana nae kwa chila akuchigesa. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Want'hu hawakulingana, mnt'hu imwe kwa kutogola kwake akudya chint'hu chochote, mbali mnt'hu imwenga kwa kutogola kwake kudodo, akudya mboga za mazani muhala. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Ila mnt'hu akudya chila chint'hu aleke kumzela ila hakudya chila chint'hu. Na ila akudya mboga za mazani muhala aleke kumulamula ila akudya vint'hu vose, kwavila Mulungu kamtogola ivoeli. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Weye niani hata kumulamula msank'hani wa miago? Kutimalala egu kungwa kwake iyo ni sank'hano ya mkulu wake, ena nae natimalale kwavila Mndewa Yesu akudaha kumtimalisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mnt'hu imwe akudaha kuitunya siku imwe kuwa ikufaya kuhuma siku imwenga, na mnt'hu imwenga akuona kuwa siku zose zikulingana. Chila mnt'hu na atende ivo kwa yala akuyatogola. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ila akuona kuwa siku imwe ni nk'hulu kuhuma siku imwenga akutenda ivo ili amtunye Mndewa. Ila akudya chochote chila, nae akutenda ivo kwaajili ya kumtunya Mndewa, kwavila akumwink'ha hewala Mulungu. Vilavila ila akudya ndia akutenda ivo kwaajili ya kumtunya Mndewa, nae akumwink'ha hewala Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kwavila habule mnt'hu akukala kwaajili yake mwenyewe, wala habule mnt'hu akudanganika kwaajili yake mwenyewe. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ikawa chiwagima, chiwagima kwaajili ya kumbwedeza Mndewa, na chikadanganika chikudanganika kwaajili ya kumbwedeza Mndewa. Ivo chikawa wagima egu chikadanganika cheye ni want'hu wa Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Nio mana Kilisito kadanganika na kubwela mugima ili adahe kuwa Mndewa wa want'hu wose weli na ugima na wadanganike. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ivo, hangi ukumulamula miago? Egu, hangi ukumzela miago? Kwavila cheye chose nachilamuligwe halongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kwavila gesa ivoiyandikigwe muna Maandiko ya Mulungu, Mndewa akulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Nie ni Mulungu nili mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">chila mnt'hu naanitumbalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na chila mnt'hu naalonge yeye mwenyewe kuwa nie ni Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ivo, chila mnt'hu naalonge mbuli azitendile halongozi ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usekumtenda miago ahasanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ivo, chileke kuwalamula wamwenga, mbali chitogolelane kuleka kutenda mbuli zikulonda kuwatenda wamwenga wagwe mzizambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Nie humanya kweli, Mndewa Yesu kanilagisa kuwa habule chint'hu chochote hachikufaya, mbali mnt'hu akaona kuwa chint'hu icho hachikufaya nachiwe hachikufaya kumwake mnt'hu iyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ndugu yako akawa anachiholo kwa ndia ukudya, aho weye nauwe hukulongozigwa na ubwedo. Ivo icho ukudya kisekutenda ndugu yako age. Kwavila Kilisito kadanganika kwaajili yake. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ivo, usekutogola chint'hu ukuchiona chidamana chizeligwa na wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwavila umwene wa Mulungu sio kwa mbuli ya kudya na kung'wa, mbali umwene wa Mulungu ni mbuli ya kutogoligwa halongozi ha Mulungu, nt'hindiwalo na ubwedo ukulawana na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ivo, mnt'hu akumsank'hanila Kilisito gesa ivo, iyo nio akumbwedeza Mulungu na kutogoligwa na want'hu. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ivoelo, tendeni mbuli zidamane zila zikugala nt'hindiwalo na yala yakuchitaza kuzengana. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Elo, usekuibananga sank'hano ya Mulungu kwa mbuli ya ndia. Ndia zose zikufaya kudigwa, mbali haikufaya kudya ndia ila ikumtenda miago aingile mzizambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Vidamana usekudya nyama wala kung'wa divai, wala usekutenda chochote cha kumuhonza miago aingile mzizambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ivo, tozeleza kila ukuchitogola hagati yako na Mulungu wako. Naabwede mnt'hu ila kutenda kila akuona kidamana bila kuilamula. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Mbali mnt'hu akawa ana mashaka na ndia ila akuidya akulamuligwa na Mulungu, naalamuligwe na Mulungu kwavila hadile kwa utogozi, na nt'hendwa yoyote haikulawana na utogozi ni zambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Watazeni wamwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Cheye chikangale muukutogola chikulondigwa kuwataza wala hawanakangala muukutogola ili wadahe kuzihuma mbuli zawe ndala. Chisekuibwedeza cheye wenyewe. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Chila mnt'hu hagati yetu akulondigwa kuwataza wamwenga kutenda yala yadamane ili kuwazenga muukutogola Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwavila Kilisito hatendile mbuli za kuitaza mwenyewe, mbali kakala gesavila Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga, “Madusi yose wakudukanile yanipata nie.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ivo mbuli zose ziandikwe mmaandiko ya Mulungu ziandikigwa kwaajili ya kuchifunza cheye ili chifinyilize muukuhenyeka kwetu na chigelwe moyo, chidahe kuwa na lolelo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mulungu nio akuchihoza moyo na akuchink'ha ufinyilizi. Elo humulomba Mulungu awatende mukale kwa moyo umwe, kwavila mkumuhiga Kilisito Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ili mweye mose kwa hamwenga na kwa sauti imwe mdahe kumtunya Mulungu, Tata wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli Idamane kwa want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ivo, muihokele mweye kwa mweye, gesa Kilisito ivoawahokeleni mweye, ili want'hu wamtunye Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Huwalongelani kuwa Kilisito kawasank'hanila Wayahudi ili alagise ukweli wa Mulungu na kuditimiza lagano da Mulungu adiikile na wasaho wetu. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Vilavila keza ili want'hu sio Wayahudi wamtunye Mulungu kwa ubazi wake. Gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Nanikwimbile nyila za kumtunya halongozi ha want'hu sio Wayahudi, Nani imbe nyila za kukutunya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Vilavila Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga, “Denk'heleleni mweye want'hu sio Wayahudi hamwenga na want'hu wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Maandiko ya Mulungu yakulonga kuwa, “Mtunyeni Mndewa mweye want'hu sio Wayahudi, Mweye want'hu wose mtunyeni Mndewa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Vilavila Isaya mulotezi wa Mulungu kalonga, “Naeze mnt'hu imwe kulawa muuweleko wa Yese, nae naawalongoze want'hu sio Wayahudi, nao nawamulolele yeye kuwa naawahonye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ivo, Mulungu eli mwanduso wa kutogola, awenk'heni denk'ho na nt'hindiwalo mukutogola kwenu, ili lolelo dyenu diongezeke kwa nguvu ya Muhe wake.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kila kilekile Paulo aandike baluwa ino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ndugu zangu, nie mwenyewe hutogola kuwa mweye mdamana, na mkumanya yose, na mkudaha kuifunza mweye kwa mweye. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Mbali niwaandikila mbuli nyingi mui baluwa ino bila kuogoha, ili niwakumbuseni kwa mbuli ya wende ula anink'hile Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ya kuwa msank'hani wa Yesu Kilisito kwa want'hu weli sio Wayahudi. Husank'hana gesa mulavant'hambiko muna kuilonga Mbuli Idamane ya Mulungu, ili want'hu weli sio Wayahudi wawe nt'hambiko itogoligwe na Mulungu, nt'hambiko itakasigwe na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ivo nikawa niiyunga na Kilisito Yesu, hudaha kuigodela sank'hano yangu kwaajili ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Sikugeza kulonga mbuli yoyote ila haitendile Kilisito muisankhano yangu, hutenda vino ili want'hu sio Wayahudi wamuhulike Mulungu kwa kulonga na kutenda, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa nguvu za vilagiso na uzonza, na kwa nguvu ya Muhe wa Mulungu. Kuandusila Yelusalemu hadi mmabululu yose yeli mnk'handa mnk'handa mwa Yelusalemu hadi kudibululu da Iluliko, niwalongela want'hu Mbuli Idamane ya Kilisito, sisigaze hant'hu hohote hala. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Mzimbuli zose, hulonda niilonge Mbuli Idamane hant'hu hala Kilisito hawanammanya. Hutenda ivo ili nisekuandusa umpya sank'hano hant'hu hala mnt'hu imwenga kaiyandusa. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Mbali gesa Maandiko ya Mulungu ivoyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Want'hu wala hawanalongeligwa mbuli zake, nawamuone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">na wala hawanahulika mbuli zake, nawamanye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akulolela kwita kudibululu dya Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Mbuli iyo nio ikunitenda mala nyingi nipotwe kwiza kumwenu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Mbali kwavila haluse nikomeleza sank'hano yangu mui isi zino, elo, hulonda nk'hani kwiza kumwenu kwavila nikala na nk'hwina ya kutenda ivo siku nyingi, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ivo hulolela kwiza kumwenu nikawa muinthambo yangu kwita isi ya Isipania. Mbali nanikale na mweye kwa siku ndodo na kudenk'helela hamwenga na mweye. Kamala mnitaze muint'hambo yangu kwita Isipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Mbali vino haluse nimui nzila kwita Yelusalemu kwita kusank'hana sankhano ya Mulungu kwa want'hu wa Mulungu weli uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwavila want'hu wamtogole Kilisito wa Makedonia na Akaya iwadamanila kuwasangila want'hu wa Mulungu weli wachiwa uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Iwabwedeza kutenda ivo, kwavila want'hu si Wayahudi wahokela vint'hu va kimuhe kulawa kwa Wayahudi, vilavila nao wakulondigwa kuwasank'hanila Wayahudi kwa vint'hu vila wakuvilonda. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ivo, nikakomeleza sank'hano ino ya kuwenk'ha Wayahudi chila wasangilwe, naniwafoseleni niwaone nikawa muint'hambo yangu ya kwita Isipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Humanya kuwa nikeza kumwenu Kilisito naawabaliki nk'hani. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ivo ndugu zangu, huwalomba nk'hani kwa zina da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito na kwa ubwedo ula ukugaligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, muiyunge na nie kwa kunilombele kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Lombeni nilawe goya hagati ya want'hu wala hawakutogola weli Uyahudi, na Sank'hano yangu kula Yelusalemu idahe kutogolwa na want'hu wa Mulungu weli Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ivo, Mulungu akabweda nanize kumwenu kwa moyo wa denkho, nikahumule hamwenga na mweye. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Mulungu akugala nthindiwalo akale hamwenga na mweye mose. Tawile.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Ndamsa za Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Hulonda mummanye lumbu dyetu Foibe, ila akusank'hanila want'hu wamtogolile Kilisito weli mdibululu da Kenkelia. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Muhokeleni goya kwaajili ya Mndewa gesa vila want'hu wa Mulungu ivo wakuhokelwa, Mwink'heni chochote chila akuchilomba kulawa kumwenu, kwavila yeye kawa mtazi wa want'hu wengi, nanie vilavila kanitaza. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ndamsileni Pilisila na Akila, wasank'hani wayangu muna usank'hani wa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Want'hu ao walawila muukauje kukomigwa ili nie nihone. Ikulondigwa wahongezwe, sio nie muhala nio hulondigwa niwahongeze, mbali vilavila kwa want'hu wa Mulungu sio Wayahudi wakumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ndamsileni want'hu wamtogole Kilisito, ao wakufikana mzinyumba zawe. Vilavila ndamsileni mbuyangu Epaineto ila akalile wamwanduso kumtogola Kilisito kulawa mkoa wa Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ndamsileni Malia ila asank'hanile nk'hani kwa ajili yenu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ndamsileni Andiloniko na Yuniya, ao ni ndugu zangu wakalile mchifungo hamwenga na nie, ao wakumanyika nk'hani na watumigwa, na ao wanilongola kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ndamsileni mbuyangu Ampiliato, ino ni miangu mui kuiyunga na Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ndamsileni Ulibano, msank'hani miyetu mukumsank'hanila Kilisito, vilavila humlamsa mbuyangu Staku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ndamsileni Apele, agezigwe na kulagisa kuwa Kilisito akumtogola kweli. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ndamsileni ndugu yangu Helodioni, na want'hu wamtogole Kilisito weli mui kaya ya Nalikiso waiyungile na Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ndamsileni Tilifaina na Tilifosa, wanawake ao wakuilava nkhani kumsank'hanila Mndewa. Vilavila humlamsa ndugu yangu Pelisi, iyo nae ni mwenamke kailava nkhani kumsankhanila Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ndamsileni Lufo, mnt'hu mgangamavu nk'hani mukumsank'hanila Mndewa, hamwenga na mami yake, akalile ge mami yangu ivila. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ndamsileni Asinkilito na Filegoni na Helima na Hema na want'hu wose weli hamwenga nao. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ndamsileni Filologo, Yuliya, Nelea na Lumbu jake, na Olimpa, na want'hu wose wa Mulungu weli hamwenga nao. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Lamsaneni kwa kulagisa mkubwedana. Ndamsa zenu kulawa kwa want'hu wose wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akukomeleza ndagilizi zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ndugu zangu, huwalombeni nk'hani kuwa muiteganye na wanthu wala wakuwatenda muibananganikilwe, na kuwatenda want'hu wengi waleke kukola yala mfunzigwe. Muinege na want'hu ao, <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />kwavila want'hu gesa ao hawakumsank'hanila Kilisito Mndewa wetu, mbali wakusank'hanila zinda zawe. Kwa mbuli zawe zidamane na ulongelo wawo wa kuhembuliza na kuyazaganya myoyo ya want'hu wadamane. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kwavila chila mnt'hu kahulika mbuli za utegelezi wenu mui mbuli Idamane, nie nimemwa na denk'ho kulu kwaajili yenu, mbali hulonda muwe na umanyi muna zimbuli zidamane na mleke kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Mulungu akuwenk'heni nthindiwalo, seke akawe kumuhonda Shetani hasi ya migulu yenu. Wende wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye. Tawile. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Msank'hani miangu, Timoseo akuwalamsa. Vilavila Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipita, Wayahudi wayangu vilavila wakuwalamsani. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Na nie Telitio niandikile balua ino, huwalamsa kwa zina dya Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Mkaya wangu Gayo, hamwenga na want'hu wose wamtogole Kilisito wala wakufikana haikaya yake wakuwalamsa. Vilavila na Elasito mkulu wa kutimalila hela mdibululu dino na ndugu yetu Kwalito wose wakuwalamsa. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Wende wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito uwe hamwenga na mweye mose. Tawile.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumtunya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Elo, atunyigwe Mulungu eli na udahi wa kuchitenda chigangamale muukutogola kwetu kufosela Mbuli Idamane ya Yesu Kilisito nikalile huilonga kumwenuniil. Mbuli iyo ikala ifisika siku nyingi. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Mbali haluse mbuli iyo igubulwa na ikumanyika kufosela maandiko ya walotezi na kwa lagilizo da Mulungu wa siku zose bila nk'homelezo ugubuligwa kwa want'hu, ili want'hu wa isi zose wamtogole na wamtegeleza. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Mulungu eli adumwenga na eli na umanyi wose, atunyigwe kufosela Yesu Kilisito siku zose bila nk'homelezo. Tawile.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>